{"id":"eb8d7865442402e1a85f539e950862830c0bc14a","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1244568","title":"AI 量化","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"he123","excerpt":"投资 - @he123 - 很多人都在用 ai 量化，或者分析各种财报，各种小工具一大堆，请问实际使用情况下，有盈利吗，收益如何。很焦虑，感觉大家都在疯狂地赚钱","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n    \n    <div><p><a href=\"/member/he123\"><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/eea48c3dabb885b92a5422490430ad23?s=73&d=retro\" alt=\"he123\" data-uid=\"613846\"></a></p>\n    \n    \n    \n     &#160; <p><small><a href=\"/member/he123\">he123</a> · <span title=\"2026-09-24 15:18:02 +08:00\">21h 14m ago</span> · 1135 views</small>\n    </p></div>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div><p>很多人都在用 ai 量化，或者分析各种财报，各种小工具一大堆，请问实际使用情况下，有盈利吗，收益如何。很焦虑，感觉大家都在疯狂地赚钱</p></div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/AI\"><li></li> AI</a><a href=\"/tag/量化\"><li></li> 量化</a><a href=\"/tag/盈利\"><li></li> 盈利</a></P><p><span>7 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-09-25 07:59:18 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18124698\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/cdfbcecfac10ddbff28d0a8edc3320df?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Razio\" data-uid=\"494931\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Razio\">Razio</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 15:31:59 +08:00\">21h 0m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>无非想让你付费、或者 github star 一下，搞点流量罢了。真赚钱的事谁愿意告诉你？又没有提成</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18124809\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/347c/a166/349560_normal.png?m=1784958765\" alt=\"insert000\" data-uid=\"349560\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/insert000\">insert000</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 15:44:42 +08:00\">20h 47m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>\"很多人\" 是多少人？ A 股是有食物链的，政策制定队&gt;大基金国家队&gt;机构队&gt;私募队&gt;游资队&gt;大佬牛散队&gt;普通散 。这里面每个层面都有 ai 量化，靠一些历史分析就能赚钱。那食物链顶端的还玩什么</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18124968\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/45ba/e325/604013_normal.png?m=1695889288\" alt=\"blackmolycat\" data-uid=\"604013\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/blackmolycat\">blackmolycat</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 16:09:21 +08:00\">20h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>交易本质是信息差和博弈，和你背后用了什么技术和理论没啥太大关系。量化没有什么 buff ，错误的方向只是加速亏钱罢了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18125687\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c7a6/a001/315058_normal.png?m=1790081922\" alt=\"pageofzk\" data-uid=\"315058\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/pageofzk\">pageofzk</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 18:52:44 +08:00\">17h 39m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>有足够的钱且别赌,小钱还是能赚点的,毛细血管不可能一直断.游资用 ai 量化赚的钱,也会被量化亏走.迭代太慢了.</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18125697\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/157a/4639/282123_normal.png?m=1745423670\" alt=\"imsuxp\" data-uid=\"282123\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/imsuxp\">imsuxp</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 18:57:44 +08:00\">17h 34m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>就一句话：如果真赚钱，你会分享出来吗？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18125700\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0b2f/c489/598051_normal.png?m=1786591349\" alt=\"CHTRCT\" data-uid=\"598051\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/CHTRCT\">CHTRCT</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-24 19:00:29 +08:00\">17h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>只有亏了钱的 AI 量化才会公开给你看到啊</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18126396\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0989/ac86/229227_normal.png?m=1762848831\" alt=\"walkon\" data-uid=\"229227\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/walkon\">walkon</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-25 07:59:18 +08:00\">4h 32m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>别搞量化这个方向，AI 也不好使，纯浪费时间。真想玩，好好自己研究下投资理论。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\